NATS server on FenrirOS
=======================

Installed inert: the service is not enabled and there is no configuration,
user or account.

    1. cp /usr/share/doc/nats-server/nats-server.conf.example \
          /etc/nats-server/nats-server.conf
       and edit it (it listens on 127.0.0.1:4222 only, JetStream storage in
       /var/lib/nats-server/jetstream, no authentication: set an
       authorization block before exposing it).
    2. dinitctl enable nats-server

Clients: nats-cli (the `nats` tool) is a separate project.
